{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52456","headline":"回波乐 九十九 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 九十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝庭来相过，设食因盃酌。\n四海同追由（项校「游」），五郡爲劝乐。\n义故及三代，死活相凭托。\n合去正身行，不容君（戴校「名」）字错。\n雇人即棒脊，急手摄你脚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}